      "body": "## Summary\n\nCloses the last acceptance nuance of #3321: activity-stream records now carry the\nstructured `source` block (`{ identity, link }`) from the #1739 `NewAuditEvent`\ncontract, instead of embedding the delivery link only in the summary text.\n\n- `ingestSerialized` in `pm-stack/aggregator/src/activity.ts` now passes\n  `source: { identity: \"pm-stack/aggregator/activity/<source>\", ...(link) }` to\n  `events.record(...)`; the summary text is unchanged, so no existing consumer\n  or test that reads summaries is affected.\n- Watchdog deliveries intentionally carry no `link` (no artifact URL exists for\n  watchdog episodes); Kaneo (`kaneoUrl`) and GitHub (`source_url`) deliveries do.\n- Regression assertion added in `test/activity-github-7084.test.ts`.\n\n## Context\n\nFresh revalidation showed the #3321 implementation scope already landed on\norigin/main:\n\n- PR #5141 (merged 2026-11-04): watchdog/Kaneo writers, `IngestionStore`\n  checkpoints, dedupe, restart resume, gap records, per-source coverage docs.\n- PR #7084: the GitHub hot-list consumer (`src/github-hot-list.ts`,\n  `githubHotEventDelivery`) with projector checkpoint acking, gap opening on\n  outage, and generated failure/restart schedules.\n\nThis PR is the strictly-additive finishing touch: the contract already has an\n`EventSource` field, but ingestion never populated it, so activity records were\nmissing stable structured source identity/links (the issue's leg-1 wording:\n\"stable source IDs and source links\"). No contract change — `events.record`\nalready honors a caller-supplied `source` and defaults identity to\n`pm-stack/aggregator`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `bun test test/activity-3321.test.ts test/activity-live-3321.test.ts test/activity-github-7084.test.ts test/events-archive-3322.test.ts` — 67 pass, 0 fail\n- [ ] Full `bun test` in `pm-stack/aggregator` (running)\n\nCloses #3321\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1797992188&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=12771&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F12771&variant=proof_this_pr&signature=4d287ab2d647368fcb618dd76d1aa21b92a1101d6ec04e014be637de18cddba3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Proof this PR\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/12771?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Recorded activity events now include source identity and, when available, a link.\n* **Tests**\n  * Added checks for source details and GitHub issue URLs in persisted events.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
