      "body": "## Summary\n\nThe aggregator now consumes the projector's #5204 hot list as a fixed-high-water sweep:\n\n```text\nGET persisted consumer cursor\n  page hot-list rows up to one pinned high-water\n  map each event_id to activity:github:<event_id>\n  persist rows + local progress\n  ack the remote cursor only after the sweep is complete\n```\n\nGitHub source status and time-ranged gaps are visible on `/events` and `/api/activity.json`; the API explicitly reports `completeHistory: false`. Coverage is limited to retained hot-list rows. Missed upstream webhook deliveries and pre-hot-list history remain unsupported. The installer copies only `PM_PROJECTOR_API_TOKEN` into the aggregator environment for checkpoint acknowledgements.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** GitHub coverage was marked unsupported and had no aggregator hot-list consumer.\n- **After:** duplicate replay, restart recovery, partial-sweep resume, outage/lag/unrecoverable-gap tests; targeted tests: **40 passed**.\n- `bash -n pm-stack/aggregator/install.sh` and `git diff --check` pass.\n- Full aggregator suite: **1802 passed, 18 failed** in this local environment. Most failures were server tests colliding with the already-running service on port 4871; four unrelated existing expectations also failed. `bun run typecheck` reports three existing test errors in `roadmap-annotations.test.ts` and `saas-extract-surrogate-7743.test.ts`; no errors were reported in the changed code.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way.\n\n**Blast Radius:** medium — additive GitHub-source consumption and status only; no receiver or projector schema change. PR #7285 is still open and overlaps shared activity files, so reconcile/merge ordering with that PR before landing; this branch does not modify #7285.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796774560&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7867&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7867&signature=3a600c9a73de538fbea5a636895f97ed47c1f178f9ef932d0c92291bd3970131\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7867?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
